schway-screen 1
screen shell-outcomes
title Shell exit evidence
description Exit codes, cancellation, timeout, unknown evidence and tool errors retain distinct text and glyphs.
variant light-80
size 80x36
cursor 7 33 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

   ✓  BASH  exit 0                                         Exit 0 · 1.2s ▸
   !  BASH  exit 7                                         Exit 7 · 1.2s ▸
   −  BASH  kill -TERM $$                                 Stopped · 1.2s ▸
   −  BASH  sleep 5                                              Stopped ▸
     Command cancelled.

   !  BASH  sleep 5                                            Timed out ▾
     Command timed out.
     Tool failed. Inspect this result before continuing.

   −  BASH  run saved command                    No exit observed · 1.2s ▸
   −  BASH  inspect invalid exit details         No exit observed · 1.2s ▸
   !  BASH  run unavailable command                           Tool error ▾
     Command could not start.
     Tool failed. Inspect this result before continuing.














